{"version" 2 "boxes" [{"id" "995d4515-cba7-425d-a369-cc80dd953245" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root"} "name" "flock" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [40.0 40.0 260.0 120.0] "autorun" false "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "995d4515-cba7-425d-a369-cc80dd953245_code_.kt" "inline" "// A flock in one dimension: n birds on a ring, each nudging toward the mean heading of its\n// neighbours. Prints how aligned the flock is after each round.\nval n = 24\nval rnd = java.util.Random(4)\nvar heading = DoubleArray(n) { rnd.nextDouble() * 2 * Math.PI }\nfun alignment(h: DoubleArray) = Math.hypot(h.sumOf { Math.cos(it) }, h.sumOf { Math.sin(it) }) / h.size\nfor (round in 0..6) {\n    println(\"round $round: alignment ${(alignment(heading)).f3}\")\n    heading =\n        DoubleArray(n) { i ->\n            val l = heading[(i + n - 1) % n]\n            val r = heading[(i + 1) % n]\n            val me = heading[i]\n            Math.atan2(Math.sin(l) + Math.sin(me) + Math.sin(r), Math.cos(l) + Math.cos(me) + Math.cos(r))\n        }\n}\n"} "notes" #afield/file-inline {"path" "995d4515-cba7-425d-a369-cc80dd953245_notes_.md" "inline" "# Flock\n\nTwenty-four birds sit on a ring. Each round, every bird turns toward the **mean heading** of\nitself and its two neighbours. `alignment` is the length of the average heading vector: 0 when the\nbirds point every which way, 1 when they all agree.\n\nRun it and watch the number climb. Neighbours only ever see neighbours, yet the whole ring comes\nto agree.\n"}}} {"id" "b4fffaa4-cf67-48c0-8108-2cd3b969a7df" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root"} "name" "chart" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [440.0 40.0 260.0 120.0] "autorun" false "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "b4fffaa4-cf67-48c0-8108-2cd3b969a7df_code_.kt" "inline" "// Draws alignment against round as an SVG polyline in the box's output.\nval values = [0.468, 0.609, 0.665, 0.702, 0.732, 0.757, 0.779]\nval pts = values.mapIndexed { i, v -> \"${20 + i * 40},${120 - v * 100}\" }.joinToString(\" \")\ndisplay(\n    \"main\",\n    \"\"\"<svg width=\"290\" height=\"140\" style=\"background:#111\">\n  <polyline points=\"$pts\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#48c9ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"11\">round 0 .. 6</text>\n</svg>\"\"\",\n)\nprintln(\"drew ${values.size} points\")\n"} "notes" #afield/file-inline {"path" "b4fffaa4-cf67-48c0-8108-2cd3b969a7df_notes_.md" "inline" "# Chart\n\nThe numbers `flock` prints, drawn as a line.\n\n| round | alignment |\n| ---: | :--- |\n| 0 | 0.468 |\n| 3 | 0.702 |\n| 6 | 0.779 |\n\n> The values are typed in rather than read from `flock`, to keep this box independent.\n"}}} {"id" "74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root"} "name" "sketch" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [240.0 340.0 200.0 80.0] "autorun" false "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12_code_.kt" "inline" "/*\nWrites this document's drawing layer: a frame around the two boxes, an arrow between them,\na heading, and a hand-drawn underline. The marks belong to this box: run it again and they\nare replaced in place.\n*/\nval flock = inside.boxes.values.first { it.name == \"flock\" }\nval chart = inside.boxes.values.first { it.name == \"chart\" }\nnotation {\n    roughness = 0.0\n    text(\"reading a flock\", 40, -70, size = 28)\n    stroke((0..40).map { vec(40 + it * 6.5, -28 + 4 * sin(it / 3.0)) }, stroke = \"#e03131\")\n    rect(20, 0, 700, 200, stroke = \"#1971c2\")\n    arrow(from = flock, to = chart, label = \"plots\")\n    ellipse(410, 230, 220, 70, label = \"converges\", fill = \"#b2f2bb\", fillStyle = \"hachure\")\n    diamond(60, 230, 140, 80, label = \"ring\", fill = \"#ffec99\")\n}\nprintln(\"${notation.mine.size} marks\")\n"} "layers" "default,annotation" "notes" #afield/file-inline {"path" "74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12_notes_.md" "inline" "# Sketch\n\nThis box writes the document's **drawing layer** from code with `notation { ... }`: a frame, an\narrow from `flock` to `chart`, a heading and a freehand underline. In Field you can also draw on\nthe layer by hand (Alt+D).\n\nThe offline viewer draws the same scene, in the same world coordinates, under the boxes.\n\n- the frame is a `rect`\n- the arrow follows the boxes when they move\n- the underline is a `stroke`, the same kind of mark as one drawn with the pen\n"}}} {"id" "root" "properties" {"children" #{#afield/box "995d4515-cba7-425d-a369-cc80dd953245" #afield/box "b4fffaa4-cf67-48c0-8108-2cd3b969a7df" #afield/box "74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12"} "parents" #{} "drawing" "{\"type\":\"excalidraw\",\"version\":2,\"source\":\"field\",\"appState\":{\"viewBackgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"gridSize\":null},\"files\":{},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12~default~0\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":40.0,\"y\":-70.0,\"width\":231.00000000000003,\"height\":35.0,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"fillStyle\":\"hachure\",\"strokeWidth\":2.0,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0.0,\"opacity\":100.0,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"roundness\":null,\"seed\":1029825506,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[],\"link\":null,\"locked\":false,\"customData\":{\"fieldOwner\":\"74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12\",\"fieldKey\":\"default\",\"fieldStroke\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"fieldFill\":\"transparent\"},\"text\":\"reading a flock\",\"originalText\":\"reading a flock\",\"fontSize\":28.0,\"fontFamily\":5,\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"verticalAlign\":\"top\",\"containerId\":null,\"autoResize\":true,\"lineHeight\":1.25,\"version\":1,\"versionNonce\":138786871,\"updated\":1792629468302},{\"id\":\"74a7be47-7f7c-421a-ad3f-10afab498c12~default~1\",\"type\":\"freedraw\",\"x\":40.0,\"y\":-28.0,\"width\":260.0,\"height\":7.981592178344727,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#ff774c\",\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"fillStyle